    {
      "kind": "html",
      "html": "\n    <div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border-radius:34px;padding:36px 40px;margin-top:30px;\"><div style=\"font-size:52px;font-weight:800;color:#0A0A0A;text-align:center;margin-bottom:24px;\">Forklaring 2/2</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:28px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(10,10,10,0.55);text-align:center;line-height:1.4;margin-bottom:26px;\">Brett ut det klippede arket én brett om gangen.</div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;\"><svg viewBox=\"-10 -10 140 180\" width=\"420\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n    <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"120\" height=\"160\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"rgba(10,10,10,0.22)\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 6\"/>\n    <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"120\" height=\"160\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/>\n    <path d=\"M 120.0 67.4 L 120.0 92.6 L 107.4 80.0 Z\" fill=\"#CED4C2\"/><line x1=\"120.0\" y1=\"92.6\" x2=\"107.4\" y2=\"80.0\" stroke=\"#0A0A0A\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><line x1=\"107.4\" y1=\"80.0\" x2=\"120.0\" y2=\"67.4\" stroke=\"#0A0A0A\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><path d=\"M 0.0 67.4 L 0.0 92.6 L 12.6 80.0 Z\" fill=\"#CED4C2\"/><line x1=\"0.0\" y1=\"92.6\" x2=\"12.6\" y2=\"80.0\" stroke=\"#0A0A0A\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><line x1=\"12.6\" y1=\"80.0\" x2=\"0.0\" y2=\"67.4\" stroke=\"#0A0A0A\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/>\n    <path d=\"M 0.0 0 L 120.0 0 M 0.0 160 L 120.0 160 M 0 0.0 L 0 67.4 M 0 92.6 L 0 160.0 M 120 0.0 L 120 67.4 M 120 92.6 L 120 160.0 \" stroke=\"#0A0A0A\" stroke-width=\"2.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n    <line x1=\"60\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"60\" y2=\"160\" stroke=\"#056B50\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 4.5\"/>\n  </svg></div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:27px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:2px;color:rgba(10,10,10,0.55);text-align:center;margin:24px 0 14px;\">Steg 2/2</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:31px;font-weight:600;color:#056B50;text-align:center;line-height:1.4;\">Brett ut fold 1: arket felles ut sideveis og klippet speiles i brettelinjen, så anta